After 18 years as a member of Magnum Photos, I have decided to leave the cooperative. I’m grateful to my Magnum colleagues for years of inspiration, and I continue to root for the success of Magnum. 
Today I am extremely thrilled (over the moon) to announce that I am joining We Folk as my new photographic home, where I am lucky to be in the presence of a new set of incredible visual artists. I can hardly contain my excitement for this new adventure
